cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or its datasets, please cite the preprint."
title: "Orbifex"
type: software
abstract: >-
  A standard-library Python generator that turns a description of one fictional
  person into a seeded workspace of mail, calendar, files and app exports at
  four sizes, with an answer key fixed before any file is written, checks that
  every answer can be recovered from the files, and exports each question as a
  Harbor task for agent evaluation.
